         <pdf:Producer>Acrobat Distiller 19.0 (Windows)</pdf:Producer>
         <pdf:Keywords>The MC34063A Series is a monolithic control circuit containing the&#xD;&#xA;primary functions required for DCâˆ’toâˆ’DC converters. These devices&#xD;&#xA;consist of an internal temperature compensated reference, comparator,&#xD;&#xA;controlled duty cycle oscillator with an active current limit circuit,&#xD;&#xA;driver and high current output switch. This series was specifically&#xD;&#xA;designed to be incorporated in Stepâˆ’Down and Stepâˆ’Up and&#xD;&#xA;Voltageâˆ’Inverting applications with a minimum number of external&#xD;&#xA;components. Refer to Application Notes AN920A/D and AN954/D&#xD;&#xA;for additional design information.</pdf:Keywords>
         <dc:format>application/pdf</dc:format>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Inverting Regulators - Buck, Boost, Switching 1.5 A</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>zbjrpg</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>The MC34063A Series is a monolithic control circuit containing the</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>primary functions required for DCâˆ’toâˆ’DC converters. These devices</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>consist of an internal temperature compensated reference</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>comparator</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>controlled duty cycle oscillator with an active current limit circuit</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>driver and high current output switch. This series was specifically</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>designed to be incorporated in Stepâˆ’Down and Stepâˆ’Up and</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Voltageâˆ’Inverting applications with a minimum number of external</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>components. Refer to Application Notes AN920A/D and AN954/D</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>for additional design information.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </dc:subject>
         <xmpMM:DocumentID>uuid:6a1caddc-bbf9-4de2-a0df-601c1d65d5ad</xmpMM:DocumentID>
